{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Bloodmage: Running Wild follows riding skill like a mount (#9356)",
  "contract": [
    "#9356 'BM Running Wild gives 100% move speed', whatever the riding skill. Running Wild 800175 effect 0 is",
    "aura 31 MOD_INCREASE_SPEED with base 60; Running Wild (Journeyman) 520575 is a hidden Add Flat Modifier +40",
    "on that effect. Decision for #9356: Running Wild follows riding skill as all other mounts do, with a 60%",
    "floor. Without riding and with Apprentice Riding (skill 75) it gives 60%; Journeyman Riding (skill 150)",
    "teaches 520575 and gives 100%; forgetting Journeyman Riding removes 520575 and drops back to 60%. The amount",
    "updates while the aura is active. Riding ranks are taught and forgotten with learn and unlearn so the player",
    "spell hooks run, as a trainer purchase does."
  ],
